{%- comment -%}
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  VARTUS PICTURE
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  Thin wrapper around image_url/image_tag shared by the Vartus editorial sections, so every floating/product image gets
  the same responsive widths, CLS-safe sizing and lazy-loading behaviour.

  ********************************************
  Supported variables
  ********************************************

  * image: the image object to render (required; nothing is output when blank)
  * class: optional class(es) applied to the <img>
  * sizes: optional sizes attribute (defaults to a full-bleed-ish guess)
  * widths: optional comma list of widths to generate (defaults to a sensible editorial range)
  * loading: "eager" or "lazy" (default "lazy")
  * fetchpriority: "high", "low" or "auto"
  * alt_fallback: text used when the image has no alt text (e.g. product.title)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if image != blank -%}
  {{-
    image
    | image_url: width: image.width
    | image_tag:
      loading: loading | default: 'lazy',
      fetchpriority: fetchpriority,
      widths: widths | default: '300,450,600,800,1000,1200,1600',
      sizes: sizes | default: '(max-width: 749px) 90vw, 40vw',
      alt: image.alt | default: alt_fallback,
      class: class
  -}}
{%- endif -%}
